{"id":"b6060c5d1003e78e","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-transversality.md","title":"Transversality Theorem","display":"thm-transversality — Transversality Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-transversality","aliases":["58-thm-transversality"],"display":"thm-transversality — Transversality Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-transverse.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-jet.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-transversality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-transversality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-transversality — Transversality Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f10cb4e88874efad\" href=\"?note=f10cb4e88874efad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-transverse.md\">../batch14/58-df-transverse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50f0afd61c5e6fe6\" href=\"?note=50f0afd61c5e6fe6\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-jet.md\">../batch04/58-df-jet.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"432be048cd519891\" href=\"?note=432be048cd519891\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md\">../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)\\)</span> (smooth manifolds)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,d\\in\\omega\">\\(r,d\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))\">\\(\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))\\)</span> (smooth embedded submanifold of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>-jet bundle)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,N)\">\\(C^\\infty(M,N)\\)</span> (smooth maps with the strong Whitney <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty\">\\(C^\\infty\\)</span> topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\)</span> (smooth-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Transverse}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Transverse}_S\\)</span> (four-place transversality predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}\\)</span> (residual-subset predicate for the strong Whitney topology)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}extension}\\vdash j^rf\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,j_x^r(f)\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}extension}\\vdash j^rf\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,j_x^r(f)\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transversality}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r,d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(M,N):\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\operatorname{Transverse}_S(j^rf,W,M,J^r(M,N))\n\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transversality}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r,d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(M,N):\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\operatorname{Transverse}_S(j^rf,W,M,J^r(M,N))\n\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thom's jet transversality theorem says that maps whose <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>-jet extension is transverse to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> form a residual subset of the strong Whitney mapping space; density follows from the standard Baire property of this mapping space.</li>\n<li>Openness requires additional hypotheses (for example suitable closedness/compactness) and is therefore not asserted unconditionally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-transverse.md","status":"resolved","id":"f10cb4e88874efad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-transverse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-jet.md","status":"resolved","id":"50f0afd61c5e6fe6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-jet.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"r,d\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Transverse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}extension}\\vdash j^rf\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,j_x^r(f)\\rangle:x\\in M\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transversality}\\vdash\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r,d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,m}(N)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_d(W,J^r(M,N))\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\operatorname{Residual}_{C^\\infty(M,N)}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(M,N):\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\operatorname{Transverse}_S(j^rf,W,M,J^r(M,N))\n\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false}],"bytes":1959,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4465","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-transversality.md|58-thm-transversality]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["f10cb4e88874efad","50f0afd61c5e6fe6","432be048cd519891","71fe0dc4c8613e69","d87c5d842ade903d"]}